  "notes": "{信|しん}じ{込|こ}む is a compound verb with ～{込|こ}む adding the sense of thoroughness or completion.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pattern: Xを{信|しん}じ{込|こ}む / Xと{信|しん}じ{込|こ}む\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {信|しん}じ{込|こ}んでいる: is firmly convinced (state)\n\nUSAGE:\nOften implies blind or possibly mistaken belief. More emphatic than {信|しん}じる alone.\n\nETYMOLOGY:\n- {信|しん}じる: to believe\n- ～{込|こ}む: suffix adding completeness/thoroughness",
